  message: "PR#2 / CASE A LANDED — PR #421, dev ebfeb204b2. Generalized the __init__.py-only re-export alias pass to NON-package facade modules via EXACT module match (global_symbols.get((resolved_module,name))), deliberately NOT the suffix-matching _lookup_symbol_by_module. The adversarial-review panel (5 refuters) flagged that suffix matching on the newly-opened non-package surface would bind a facade's 'from json import dumps' re-export to a coincidentally same-suffixed in-tree pkg/json.py — a confidently-wrong INV-fahub violation; exact match resolves the 10 intra-repo re-exports (all exact) and fails safe to a phantom otherwise. __init__ pass left BYTE-IDENTICAL (re_exported package-surface modifier stays __init__-only; no src-layout regression). A single (module_name,local_name)-in-global_symbols guard gives local-def-wins + fixed-point idempotence (cap 5). Adversarial review returned GO_WITH_FIXES; both majors fixed pre-merge: (A) exact-match; (B) the original shadow-guard test was a FALSE-GREEN (shadow guard was fully redundant with the dedup guard) — collapsed to the single dedup guard + added a real external-shadow regression lock. Behavioral (self-analysis): phantom hypergumbo_* externals 68->58, calls-reached 16->6. Coherence-neutral (un-allow-listed offenders 28, unchanged; self-tree ratchet green). 100% cov; smart-test 3786 passed. WI-hotug scope (CASE A 10 + CASE B 38) COMPLETE. Deferred residual NOT in WI-hotug: 52 module_attr_ref (WI-huhum), 5 scip_pb2 submodule-receivers, 1 copy (WI-zigah), 1 TrackerApp class-receiver."  # 230c
